 quartets carry out Valentine’s-season singing requests around campus.","evidence_claim":"Penn documents Glee Club Valentines as a long-standing annual tradition in which student quartets fulfill campus order requests each Valentine’s season.","source_url":"https://osa.universitylife.upenn.edu/campus-traditions/","source_title":"Campus Traditions | Office of Student Affairs","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Seasonal program; consult the Glee Club for availability and ordering details.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"penn-homecoming-weekend","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Homecoming Weekend","title":"Homecoming Weekend","subtitle":"Annual return to Penn in November","notes":"Review the official Homecoming schedule, select an all-ages program, and plan around its football game, arts, and campus-community activities.","short_summary":"Penn’s annual November reunion weekend brings alumni, families, friends, and campus events together.","evidence_claim":"Penn identifies Homecoming Weekend as an annual tradition welcoming alumni, families, and friends back to campus each November.","source_url":"https://pennfund.upenn.edu/events/homecoming-weekend/","source_title":"Homecoming Weekend 2024 | The Penn Fund","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Annual weekend; individual events can have separate registration or admission requirements.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"penn-spring-fling","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Spring Fling","title":"Spring Fling in the Quad","subtitle":"Annual spring tradition begun in 1973","notes":"Watch for the current student-organized program, then use official entry and accessibility guidance for activities held in and ar